        <li><strong>GMT 00:00 to 06:59:</strong> Results in MST 17:00 to 23:59 on the <strong>PREVIOUS calendar date</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>GMT 07:00:</strong> Results in MST 00:00 (midnight) at the start of the <strong>SAME calendar date</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>GMT 12:00:</strong> Results in MST 05:00 AM on the <strong>SAME calendar date</strong>.</li>
        <li><strong>GMT 19:00:</strong> Results in MST 12:00 PM (noon) on the <strong>SAME calendar date</strong>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
